{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:98143ac36c4823592a27dccbb3d5af8e1a3e86e2fce7ba989117d4a180e719e7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000005:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc814471261d296c16f0932b1247534c5435edf404673512470fe76394dc9e15",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父，\n辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cda7859a2af723f549a140921d66d3a0417370fb667914e41c940ab5c067bd7",
      "text": "我找出了之前在派送会上给粉丝们的写真照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c3da4ecc88291b275b6b58d7d885d8c8e63c2715552e87e80441989165c8dd6",
      "text": "觉得好怀念，忍不住就打了电话。\n师父还记得拍摄时候的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6266dd8cfa7bf89df189681bc95666ae96ebb1de915cb95a1a3166a60993e3b6",
      "text": "就是大家勾肩搭背拍的那张。\n哈哈，明明才过去不久，却觉得好怀念啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dd1c59d264b1d0ec5931b43957a89ec39198ad7a344c7d5b5d3fe91a6d3cc14",
      "text": "拍摄的时候，师父一直在守护着我们对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89af27417f9dd8c0bfa10ae34f694a23121835021a03308777b71ba5eb1f3f9c",
      "text": "多亏了师父，\n我感觉大家之间的距离拉近了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d408595fc79aedb6601f2c2a2f9c7610c1d31a00f191ce57008a3cd9173a6cff",
      "text": "是因为大家本身就很有团结力哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36aba4d49ac834570df30557fe91741375a041b2ed81fe9dc542007d388296d9",
      "text": "哈哈，谢谢师父相信我们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eaa7595a06fa4fcdc448085267c05a54c403e8e3aecb3694ca77fe7e5254eca",
      "text": "从那以后，我和当时的成员们聊天的次数\n还有聚在一起的次数都变多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_303_2_3_039_03_09_a:2_3_039_03_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9fd623de81d2597bcfdc94962d9c86f1f120eb4b202d1948d55c99486cf7e8d",
      "text": "为了某天还能再和那个阵容一起工作，\n我今后也会继续努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
